<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich Aug inflation rate steady at 0.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich Aug inflation rate steady at 0.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Zurich, Switzerland's largest city, rose 0.2 percent in August from the previous month for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.6 percent, the city's statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Aug 1996     July 1996	Aug 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change    0.2 pct	-0.1 pct	0.3  pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		 0.6 pct	 0.6 pct	1.7  pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  102.8	   102.5	   102.2</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
